{"pageId":"14cafadf-3b62-4eae-8052-f734d7a23b88","pageCanonId":"52808ced-97c2-4719-a022-baf4d5a60509","title":"Material Android 以 Compose 优先（Material Android is Compose-first）","slug":"material-is-compose-first","headerTitle":"Material Android 以 Compose 优先","description":"开始迁移到 Compose，尽享 Material 的最新成果","headerAlignment":"LEFT","isDescriptionVisible":false,"updatedTimestamp":"2026-07-08T11:13:50.193Z","headerImageUrl":"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/design-spec/o/projects%2Fm3%2Fimages%2Fmra8j8ky-is-compose-first-header.jpg?alt=media&token=56d2e7e1-955c-4e9c-b7fd-ec034442c368","sections":[{"pageSectionId":"b4b0e91d-2302-4f5e-b01b-1d22bb20b748","pageSectionCanonId":"a268eff6-3f93-4e88-9fde-98fb29ed6855","name":"Tab 1","position":0,"pageId":"0a045c21-c609-45ae-9809-8c18e513319f","pageCanonId":"52808ced-97c2-4719-a022-baf4d5a60509","isVisible":true,"contentBlocks":[{"pageContentBlockId":"9e126037-da43-4637-9bc2-f00dd8c3d6d5","pageContentBlockCanonId":"3e92d1fc-a1ff-49ca-8d86-97b503d8d7a0","isHidden":false,"isSqueezed":false,"title":null,"pageSectionId":"b4b0e91d-2302-4f5e-b01b-1d22bb20b748","pageSectionCanonId":"a268eff6-3f93-4e88-9fde-98fb29ed6855","contentChunks":[{"pageContentChunkId":"46c09f62-d8d4-475e-833c-83ce9abdc7c3","pageContentChunkCanonId":"fb25565a-2146-4ba7-88f3-c8948fe6b1d4","htmlValue":null,"footer":"<p><strong>Material Android</strong></p>","imageUrl":"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/design-spec/o/projects%2Fm3%2Fimages%2Fmpgoi79o-unnamed%20(1).jpg?alt=media&token=bf456b15-80d0-4283-8c2a-757ff824b662","imageUrlFife":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/FX52oDfuX9BS3Q8SWlAHzrBkPsBwAIGisPDUhj7RhOPDVYaR5hfIWqtTlf5VhE7Ru8e1eyidIjncoe2ygT_uq-WqxV-dh94K6U6YY3ysEi4=s512","imageHeight":512,"imageWidth":512,"altText":"","videoUrl":null,"videoHeight":null,"videoWidth":null,"codeUrl":null,"prototypeUrl":null,"resourceName":null,"libraryModuleType":null,"moduleConfigurationOverrides":null,"contentChunkType":"IMAGE","crbHeight":500,"linkUrl":null,"openLinkUrlInNewWindow":false,"showBorderAroundMedia":false,"useSolidBackgroundOnMedia":true,"isControl":false,"captionModifier":"DO","captionModifierCustomName":"#data-origin-author","flex":1,"autoplayVideo":null,"snippetCode":null,"snippetLanguage":null,"snippetLineNumbers":true,"updatedTimestamp":"2026-07-07T06:03:46.750Z"},{"pageContentChunkId":"d2714ebe-820a-43c6-8dd6-085b91b7be36","pageContentChunkCanonId":"3457c644-45ce-47a3-8c12-edb8bc1ac04e","htmlValue":null,"footer":null,"imageUrl":null,"imageUrlFife":null,"imageHeight":null,"imageWidth":null,"altText":"","videoUrl":null,"videoHeight":null,"videoWidth":null,"codeUrl":null,"prototypeUrl":null,"resourceName":null,"libraryModuleType":null,"moduleConfigurationOverrides":null,"contentChunkType":"EMPTY","crbHeight":500,"linkUrl":null,"openLinkUrlInNewWindow":true,"showBorderAroundMedia":false,"useSolidBackgroundOnMedia":true,"isControl":false,"captionModifier":null,"captionModifierCustomName":null,"flex":1,"autoplayVideo":null,"snippetCode":null,"snippetLanguage":null,"snippetLineNumbers":true,"updatedTimestamp":"2026-07-07T06:03:46.750Z"},{"pageContentChunkId":"6a02059c-6cfd-47d9-9781-2b7f67b2cc9b","pageContentChunkCanonId":"bde3540d-0d7a-4ef1-a257-b8dc92d00286","htmlValue":null,"footer":null,"imageUrl":null,"imageUrlFife":null,"imageHeight":null,"imageWidth":null,"altText":null,"videoUrl":null,"videoHeight":null,"videoWidth":null,"codeUrl":null,"prototypeUrl":null,"resourceName":null,"libraryModuleType":null,"moduleConfigurationOverrides":null,"contentChunkType":"EMPTY","crbHeight":500,"linkUrl":null,"openLinkUrlInNewWindow":true,"showBorderAroundMedia":false,"useSolidBackgroundOnMedia":true,"isControl":false,"captionModifier":null,"captionModifierCustomName":null,"flex":1,"autoplayVideo":null,"snippetCode":null,"snippetLanguage":null,"snippetLineNumbers":true,"updatedTimestamp":"2026-07-07T06:03:46.750Z"}]},{"pageContentBlockId":"31153d29-9648-4006-b50a-bd7bcf156bf3","pageContentBlockCanonId":"fa1bc831-9c17-4665-a450-67509106a888","isHidden":false,"isSqueezed":true,"title":null,"pageSectionId":"b4b0e91d-2302-4f5e-b01b-1d22bb20b748","pageSectionCanonId":"a268eff6-3f93-4e88-9fde-98fb29ed6855","contentChunks":[{"pageContentChunkId":"103f1724-b3aa-4f82-9d2b-d21beef8f4f5","pageContentChunkCanonId":"4daf0453-61a7-44dd-9e69-010d946d2510","htmlValue":"<p>在 <a href=\"https://io.google/2026\" target=\"_blank\">Google I/O 2026</a> 上，我们宣布了<a href=\"https://io.google/2026/explore/technical-session-30\" target=\"_blank\">Material Android 将“全力以赴”投入 Compose</a>，并同时发布了正式的<a href=\"https://android-developers.googleblog.com/2026/05/android-ui-development-is-compose-first.html\" target=\"_blank\">Android Compose 优先公告</a>，标志着 Android 开发迈入新篇章。</p><p>2026 年晚些时候，我们将把 M3 Expressive 实验 API 转为稳定版，使 <a href=\"https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/compose/designsystems/material3?_gl=1*1gllpir*_ga*NTY0NTY0OTE2LjE3NzkzMzg2Nzg.*_ga_QPQ2NRV856*czE3Nzk0Mzk2NzgkbzckZzEkdDE3Nzk0Mzk2ODQkajU0JGwwJGgw\" target=\"_blank\">Material Compose</a> 1.5.0 正式发布。此外，我们还将集成全新的 <a href=\"https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/compose/styles?_gl=1*1gllpir*_ga*NTY0NTY0OTE2LjE3NzkzMzg2Nzg.*_ga_QPQ2NRV856*czE3Nzk0Mzk2NzgkbzckZzEkdDE3Nzk0Mzk2ODQkajU0JGwwJGgw\" target=\"_blank\">Styles API </a>，带来更轻松、更灵活的自定义能力，并且已将 <a href=\"https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/compose/layouts/adaptive/build-adaptive-navigation?_gl=1*1gfyy5b*_ga*NTY0NTY0OTE2LjE3NzkzMzg2Nzg.*_ga_QPQ2NRV856*czE3Nzk0Mzk2NzgkbzckZzEkdDE3Nzk0Mzk2ODQkajU0JGwwJGgw\" target=\"_blank\">Navigation3</a> 集成到 Material 自适应库中。</p><p>为了在今后专注于 Compose，<a href=\"https://github.com/material-components/material-components-android/releases/tag/1.14.0\" target=\"_blank\">Material Views 1.14.0</a>（MDC-Android）将成为 Views 库的最后一个稳定版本。现在是迁移到 <a href=\"https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/compose/migrate/migrate-xml-views-to-jetpack-compose\" target=\"_blank\">Jetpack Compose</a> 的最佳时机。</p><p></p>","footer":null,"imageUrl":"","imageUrlFife":null,"imageHeight":null,"imageWidth":null,"altText":"","videoUrl":null,"videoHeight":null,"videoWidth":null,"codeUrl":null,"prototypeUrl":null,"resourceName":null,"libraryModuleType":null,"moduleConfigurationOverrides":null,"contentChunkType":"TEXT","crbHeight":500,"linkUrl":null,"openLinkUrlInNewWindow":true,"showBorderAroundMedia":false,"useSolidBackgroundOnMedia":true,"isControl":false,"captionModifier":null,"captionModifierCustomName":null,"flex":1,"autoplayVideo":null,"snippetCode":null,"snippetLanguage":null,"snippetLineNumbers":true,"updatedTimestamp":"2026-07-07T06:03:46.752Z"}]},{"pageContentBlockId":"458e5d9b-eabd-44d4-b795-40fb6f86c07c","pageContentBlockCanonId":"f0ed2b8f-98f2-4ed3-8cc9-41a29ff79fb6","isHidden":false,"isSqueezed":false,"title":null,"pageSectionId":"b4b0e91d-2302-4f5e-b01b-1d22bb20b748","pageSectionCanonId":"a268eff6-3f93-4e88-9fde-98fb29ed6855","contentChunks":[{"pageContentChunkId":"65c70bb1-9040-4772-bea8-c34bd8da7ab4","pageContentChunkCanonId":"f527c20f-23e6-4f28-a30c-f3c0c5539eac","htmlValue":"","footer":"","imageUrl":"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/design-spec/o/projects%2Fm3%2Fimages%2Fmov66zhn-02-IO26_133_TSV.png?alt=media&token=abb14179-640f-4e4c-be32-84a44b900746","imageUrlFife":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/eyRCYJ5DO3RV3ytnjO4Em1AW7huZ6GD234RPi1Fmsu1IyV3toeJo9kJ9FMZBqn9vuVc1MVujOSZisan6PYUxDzJUFH1lH-AMfbgJYJaSkLQj=s2500","imageHeight":1406,"imageWidth":2500,"altText":"文字：Compose Material 3 即将进入稳定版。","videoUrl":null,"videoHeight":null,"videoWidth":null,"codeUrl":null,"prototypeUrl":null,"resourceName":null,"libraryModuleType":null,"moduleConfigurationOverrides":null,"contentChunkType":"IMAGE","crbHeight":500,"linkUrl":null,"openLinkUrlInNewWindow":false,"showBorderAroundMedia":false,"useSolidBackgroundOnMedia":true,"isControl":false,"captionModifier":null,"captionModifierCustomName":null,"flex":1,"autoplayVideo":null,"snippetCode":null,"snippetLanguage":null,"snippetLineNumbers":true,"updatedTimestamp":"2026-07-07T06:03:46.840Z"}]},{"pageContentBlockId":"e656b0e5-566f-40d4-9d6f-e12f3950808d","pageContentBlockCanonId":"e90dd162-b53d-4244-ac54-ae7a76249274","isHidden":false,"isSqueezed":true,"title":null,"pageSectionId":"b4b0e91d-2302-4f5e-b01b-1d22bb20b748","pageSectionCanonId":"a268eff6-3f93-4e88-9fde-98fb29ed6855","contentChunks":[{"pageContentChunkId":"8e4767ba-c150-41cf-a1f6-b962e33a3a74","pageContentChunkCanonId":"7a94c06a-074a-4a8b-ae95-8900e72a938a","htmlValue":"<h2>Material Views 的最终版本</h2><p>多年来，Material Design 一直在重新定义如何在 Android 上构建 UI 的旅程中前行。我们见证了 <a href=\"https://developer.android.com/compose\" target=\"_blank\">Jetpack Compose</a> 从一个雄心勃勃的想法成长为全球最精美应用背后的引擎。作为 Android 的现代声明式工具包，它旨在用更少的代码和强大的原生工具来简化并加速 UI 开发。</p><p>在 Compose 持续提速的同时，我们对 Views 的更新已变得更加聚焦。过去几年，我们一直在为 Android 开发的根本性转变做准备。</p>","footer":null,"imageUrl":"","imageUrlFife":null,"imageHeight":null,"imageWidth":null,"altText":"","videoUrl":null,"videoHeight":null,"videoWidth":null,"codeUrl":null,"prototypeUrl":null,"resourceName":null,"libraryModuleType":null,"moduleConfigurationOverrides":null,"contentChunkType":"TEXT","crbHeight":500,"linkUrl":null,"openLinkUrlInNewWindow":true,"showBorderAroundMedia":false,"useSolidBackgroundOnMedia":true,"isControl":false,"captionModifier":null,"captionModifierCustomName":null,"flex":1,"autoplayVideo":null,"snippetCode":null,"snippetLanguage":null,"snippetLineNumbers":true,"updatedTimestamp":"2026-07-07T06:03:46.841Z"}]},{"pageContentBlockId":"cfa42aef-b236-4b6f-8f3a-2defe21491df","pageContentBlockCanonId":"e71c6d0b-2cf9-4f21-9ba2-1465b7e35470","isHidden":false,"isSqueezed":true,"title":null,"pageSectionId":"b4b0e91d-2302-4f5e-b01b-1d22bb20b748","pageSectionCanonId":"a268eff6-3f93-4e88-9fde-98fb29ed6855","contentChunks":[{"pageContentChunkId":"0fff2211-5d88-477e-8b4f-34bff71e3536","pageContentChunkCanonId":"8484e2fd-f0cc-4b1e-9c9a-572fed0d852d","htmlValue":"","footer":"","imageUrl":null,"imageUrlFife":null,"imageHeight":null,"imageWidth":null,"altText":"一组富有表现力的 UI 集合，包括媒体播放器、加载器、闹钟、聊天界面等。","videoUrl":"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/design-spec/o/projects%2Fm3%2Fimages%2Fmpgotv3m-16x9_Homepage_Hero_050825.mp4?alt=media&token=b9938c89-ce42-42a6-9b02-e8ea226872b0","videoHeight":2000,"videoWidth":4000,"codeUrl":null,"prototypeUrl":null,"resourceName":null,"libraryModuleType":null,"moduleConfigurationOverrides":null,"contentChunkType":"VIDEO","crbHeight":500,"linkUrl":null,"openLinkUrlInNewWindow":false,"showBorderAroundMedia":false,"useSolidBackgroundOnMedia":true,"isControl":false,"captionModifier":null,"captionModifierCustomName":null,"flex":1,"autoplayVideo":true,"snippetCode":null,"snippetLanguage":null,"snippetLineNumbers":true,"updatedTimestamp":"2026-07-07T06:03:46.842Z"}]},{"pageContentBlockId":"93594da8-5a55-4ee4-9d64-93a2ed25ca45","pageContentBlockCanonId":"42cc0498-23c4-4b2f-a315-a306d3b9351d","isHidden":false,"isSqueezed":false,"title":null,"pageSectionId":"b4b0e91d-2302-4f5e-b01b-1d22bb20b748","pageSectionCanonId":"a268eff6-3f93-4e88-9fde-98fb29ed6855","contentChunks":[{"pageContentChunkId":"2973af75-7351-4afa-9fdc-92c59d89b7f4","pageContentChunkCanonId":"5c0171d3-203b-405c-8112-a7226bdce178","htmlValue":"<p>本月早些时候，我们达成了一个重要里程碑：<a href=\"https://github.com/material-components/material-components-android/releases/tag/1.14.0\" target=\"_blank\">Material Views 1.14.0</a>（MDC-Android）稳定版发布。该版本正式将 Material 3 Expressive 带入 Views 框架，同时还包含其他改进，为 Android 开发者解锁更愉悦的体验：</p><ul><li><p>Expressive 主题</p></li><li><p>Expressive 列表组件</p></li><li><p>强调型字阶</p></li><li><p>为按钮、滑块、进度指示器等 11 个现有组件提供的 Expressive 样式</p></li></ul><p>随着此版本发布，Material Views 库正式进入<strong>维护模式</strong>。它不会再获得新功能，但会继续收到关键错误修复。</p>","footer":null,"imageUrl":"","imageUrlFife":null,"imageHeight":null,"imageWidth":null,"altText":"","videoUrl":null,"videoHeight":null,"videoWidth":null,"codeUrl":null,"prototypeUrl":null,"resourceName":null,"libraryModuleType":null,"moduleConfigurationOverrides":null,"contentChunkType":"TEXT","crbHeight":500,"linkUrl":null,"openLinkUrlInNewWindow":true,"showBorderAroundMedia":false,"useSolidBackgroundOnMedia":true,"isControl":false,"captionModifier":null,"captionModifierCustomName":null,"flex":1,"autoplayVideo":null,"snippetCode":null,"snippetLanguage":null,"snippetLineNumbers":true,"updatedTimestamp":"2026-07-07T06:03:46.842Z"}]},{"pageContentBlockId":"ccbd9f98-be3f-45b8-8df5-73c1d653265b","pageContentBlockCanonId":"7d0e7d90-347c-4bb5-b7dc-125a34c10ac5","isHidden":false,"isSqueezed":false,"title":null,"pageSectionId":"b4b0e91d-2302-4f5e-b01b-1d22bb20b748","pageSectionCanonId":"a268eff6-3f93-4e88-9fde-98fb29ed6855","contentChunks":[{"pageContentChunkId":"4c0cd6d8-fbc1-4c6c-a296-cdb84f9a0431","pageContentChunkCanonId":"5403bec7-80ca-4f4d-bdf6-8fb7e535dbbe","htmlValue":"<h2>走向 Compose 优先</h2><p>今后，Material Android 将进行转型，把所有功能开发聚焦到 <a href=\"https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/compose/designsystems/material3?_gl=1*wkss8e*_ga*NTY0NTY0OTE2LjE3NzkzMzg2Nzg.*_ga_QPQ2NRV856*czE3Nzk0Mzk2NzgkbzckZzEkdDE3Nzk0NDAyMjUkajYwJGwwJGgw\" target=\"_blank\">Material Compose 库</a>上。</p><p>2026 年晚些时候，Material Android 将发布 Compose 1.5.0，将包括 M3 Expressive 在内的 M3 实验 API 转为稳定版。M3 Expressive API 就像 M3 的扩展包；你可以选择启用它们，以提供更高品质的 Android 体验。其中包括 Expressive 更新中的 Material 3 Expressive 组件、动效系统等内容。<a href=\"https://m3.material.io/blog/building-with-m3-expressive?utm_source=blog&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=IO26\" target=\"_self\">了解 M3 Expressive</a></p><p>对设计师而言，<a href=\"https://www.figma.com/community/file/1035203688168086460/material-3-design-kit\" target=\"_blank\">Material 3 Figma Design Kit</a> 和我们的<a href=\"https://m3.material.io/\" target=\"_blank\">设计指南</a>将持续反映 Material Compose 库中的最新内容。</p>","footer":null,"imageUrl":"","imageUrlFife":null,"imageHeight":null,"imageWidth":null,"altText":"","videoUrl":null,"videoHeight":null,"videoWidth":null,"codeUrl":null,"prototypeUrl":null,"resourceName":null,"libraryModuleType":null,"moduleConfigurationOverrides":null,"contentChunkType":"TEXT","crbHeight":500,"linkUrl":null,"openLinkUrlInNewWindow":true,"showBorderAroundMedia":false,"useSolidBackgroundOnMedia":true,"isControl":false,"captionModifier":null,"captionModifierCustomName":null,"flex":1,"autoplayVideo":null,"snippetCode":null,"snippetLanguage":null,"snippetLineNumbers":true,"updatedTimestamp":"2026-07-07T06:03:46.844Z"}]},{"pageContentBlockId":"e3bcd499-d55d-419f-aa28-79f1fd1e5a93","pageContentBlockCanonId":"a2803b39-846e-4a55-9e08-bb1ffdbb2687","isHidden":false,"isSqueezed":true,"title":null,"pageSectionId":"b4b0e91d-2302-4f5e-b01b-1d22bb20b748","pageSectionCanonId":"a268eff6-3f93-4e88-9fde-98fb29ed6855","contentChunks":[{"pageContentChunkId":"74c07a1b-19b1-4194-b4dd-dcbe43ad421e","pageContentChunkCanonId":"2f417a78-be70-4653-8dee-055d37047cff","htmlValue":"<h2>Styles API 与自适应导航</h2><p>我们还宣布了即将进行的集成：将 Compose <a href=\"https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/compose/styles?_gl=1*u33d9*_ga*NTY0NTY0OTE2LjE3NzkzMzg2Nzg.*_ga_QPQ2NRV856*czE3Nzk0Mzk2NzgkbzckZzEkdDE3Nzk0NDA4NzUkajQzJGwwJGgw\" target=\"_blank\">Styles</a> 以及最近发布的<a href=\"https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/compose/layouts/adaptive/build-adaptive-navigation?_gl=1*1o80alu*_ga*NTY0NTY0OTE2LjE3NzkzMzg2Nzg.*_ga_QPQ2NRV856*czE3Nzk0Mzk2NzgkbzckZzEkdDE3Nzk0NDA4ODAkajM4JGwwJGgw\" target=\"_blank\">自适应导航（Adaptive Navigation）</a>更新<a href=\"https://developer.android.com/guide/navigation/navigation-3?_gl=1*1ka87s6*_ga*NTY0NTY0OTE2LjE3NzkzMzg2Nzg.*_ga_QPQ2NRV856*czE3Nzk0Mzk2NzgkbzckZzEkdDE3Nzk0NDA5MDAkajE4JGwwJGgw\" target=\"_blank\">与全新的 Navigation3 库相结合</a>。</p>","footer":null,"imageUrl":"","imageUrlFife":null,"imageHeight":null,"imageWidth":null,"altText":"","videoUrl":null,"videoHeight":null,"videoWidth":null,"codeUrl":null,"prototypeUrl":null,"resourceName":null,"libraryModuleType":null,"moduleConfigurationOverrides":null,"contentChunkType":"TEXT","crbHeight":500,"linkUrl":null,"openLinkUrlInNewWindow":true,"showBorderAroundMedia":false,"useSolidBackgroundOnMedia":true,"isControl":false,"captionModifier":null,"captionModifierCustomName":null,"flex":1,"autoplayVideo":null,"snippetCode":null,"snippetLanguage":null,"snippetLineNumbers":true,"updatedTimestamp":"2026-07-07T06:03:46.845Z"}]},{"pageContentBlockId":"2562c3d1-864e-455a-9505-984ba1b3586c","pageContentBlockCanonId":"00fec299-8bb4-43bd-ad8b-8eeb8cdd8be1","isHidden":false,"isSqueezed":true,"title":null,"pageSectionId":"b4b0e91d-2302-4f5e-b01b-1d22bb20b748","pageSectionCanonId":"a268eff6-3f93-4e88-9fde-98fb29ed6855","contentChunks":[{"pageContentChunkId":"b04abfcb-0fa1-4128-9977-e5ae3146ad99","pageContentChunkCanonId":"8efbfb4e-99f6-4e83-8352-265501ef71b7","htmlValue":"","footer":"","imageUrl":null,"imageUrlFife":null,"imageHeight":null,"imageWidth":null,"altText":"触发 Styles API 标注时，Material Components 标注的形状和颜色会随之变化。","videoUrl":"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/design-spec/o/projects%2Fm3%2Fimages%2Fmowkaw0g-03-Shapes%20(1).mp4?alt=media&token=1080258c-9bec-452b-ac75-c1549dd31e69","videoHeight":1548,"videoWidth":2754,"codeUrl":null,"prototypeUrl":null,"resourceName":null,"libraryModuleType":null,"moduleConfigurationOverrides":null,"contentChunkType":"VIDEO","crbHeight":500,"linkUrl":null,"openLinkUrlInNewWindow":false,"showBorderAroundMedia":false,"useSolidBackgroundOnMedia":true,"isControl":false,"captionModifier":null,"captionModifierCustomName":null,"flex":1,"autoplayVideo":true,"snippetCode":null,"snippetLanguage":null,"snippetLineNumbers":true,"updatedTimestamp":"2026-07-07T06:03:46.847Z"}]},{"pageContentBlockId":"a36f46fe-d83e-46e4-90e9-ad7c555676f2","pageContentBlockCanonId":"181d4a02-aa6e-4c4a-87ba-85fc740900ef","isHidden":false,"isSqueezed":true,"title":null,"pageSectionId":"b4b0e91d-2302-4f5e-b01b-1d22bb20b748","pageSectionCanonId":"a268eff6-3f93-4e88-9fde-98fb29ed6855","contentChunks":[{"pageContentChunkId":"64aa4f8d-15ea-4b5f-a497-dd3422a28417","pageContentChunkCanonId":"3e38e60a-a781-46f2-99bb-817c035cae22","htmlValue":"<p>Android 上的 <a href=\"https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/compose/styles?_gl=1*1ycph1f*_ga*NTY0NTY0OTE2LjE3NzkzMzg2Nzg.*_ga_QPQ2NRV856*czE3Nzk0Mzk2NzgkbzckZzEkdDE3Nzk0NDA5MTkkajYwJGwwJGgw\" target=\"_blank\">Compose Styles API</a> 将让自定义 Material 组件变得前所未有地容易。它通过在样式更新期间跳过组合阶段来提升整体应用性能，并简化统一品牌体验的创建。集成工作仍在进行中，敬请期待！</p>","footer":null,"imageUrl":"","imageUrlFife":null,"imageHeight":null,"imageWidth":null,"altText":"","videoUrl":null,"videoHeight":null,"videoWidth":null,"codeUrl":null,"prototypeUrl":null,"resourceName":null,"libraryModuleType":null,"moduleConfigurationOverrides":null,"contentChunkType":"TEXT","crbHeight":500,"linkUrl":null,"openLinkUrlInNewWindow":true,"showBorderAroundMedia":false,"useSolidBackgroundOnMedia":true,"isControl":false,"captionModifier":null,"captionModifierCustomName":null,"flex":1,"autoplayVideo":null,"snippetCode":null,"snippetLanguage":null,"snippetLineNumbers":true,"updatedTimestamp":"2026-07-07T06:03:46.847Z"}]},{"pageContentBlockId":"846f33ce-ab5d-4c7f-87f7-9e34c7631aee","pageContentBlockCanonId":"867f2e8a-c084-485f-abb1-3a2a4ddb884e","isHidden":false,"isSqueezed":true,"title":null,"pageSectionId":"b4b0e91d-2302-4f5e-b01b-1d22bb20b748","pageSectionCanonId":"a268eff6-3f93-4e88-9fde-98fb29ed6855","contentChunks":[{"pageContentChunkId":"124de0c8-7223-4314-8a4b-91483b8827e3","pageContentChunkCanonId":"083af620-9c74-47e9-9e95-e898a7e39ac6","htmlValue":"","footer":"","imageUrl":null,"imageUrlFife":null,"imageHeight":null,"imageWidth":null,"altText":"在手机上是底部导航栏，在平板上则是侧边导航栏。颜色主题会通过样式动态变化。","videoUrl":"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/design-spec/o/projects%2Fm3%2Fimages%2Fmpgrimcu-04-Shrine%20Color%20Change%20(2%20Loops).mp4?alt=media&token=b5541790-9f17-4439-8b64-51b5efa01bdc","videoHeight":2160,"videoWidth":3840,"codeUrl":null,"prototypeUrl":null,"resourceName":null,"libraryModuleType":null,"moduleConfigurationOverrides":null,"contentChunkType":"VIDEO","crbHeight":500,"linkUrl":null,"openLinkUrlInNewWindow":false,"showBorderAroundMedia":false,"useSolidBackgroundOnMedia":true,"isControl":false,"captionModifier":null,"captionModifierCustomName":null,"flex":1,"autoplayVideo":true,"snippetCode":null,"snippetLanguage":null,"snippetLineNumbers":true,"updatedTimestamp":"2026-07-07T06:03:46.848Z"}]},{"pageContentBlockId":"7254ed0c-d888-42d1-aad7-67b2d37880dc","pageContentBlockCanonId":"93be3b38-c8d2-4861-87ab-387853632387","isHidden":false,"isSqueezed":true,"title":null,"pageSectionId":"b4b0e91d-2302-4f5e-b01b-1d22bb20b748","pageSectionCanonId":"a268eff6-3f93-4e88-9fde-98fb29ed6855","contentChunks":[{"pageContentChunkId":"f75a12e4-9c86-42f8-891c-8919c3fa0d69","pageContentChunkCanonId":"1043ada2-b548-4554-9762-6a6ab2665203","htmlValue":"<p>长期以来，为可折叠设备、平板电脑和桌面设备构建自适应布局十分复杂，需要开发者在整个应用中管理多种导航框架并在它们之间切换。为解决这一问题，我们将 Material Adaptive 库与 <a href=\"https://developer.android.com/guide/navigation/navigation-3?_gl=1*1qvzpce*_ga*NTY0NTY0OTE2LjE3NzkzMzg2Nzg.*_ga_QPQ2NRV856*czE3Nzk0Mzk2NzgkbzckZzEkdDE3Nzk0NDA5OTYkajYwJGwwJGgw\" target=\"_blank\">Navigation3</a> 深度集成。由于导航库现在能通过元数据理解屏幕的意图，它会替你完成繁重的工作，让实现高效得多。<a href=\"https://developer.android.com/develop/adaptive-apps\" target=\"_blank\">立即使用 Material 组件构建自适应 UI</a></p>","footer":null,"imageUrl":"","imageUrlFife":null,"imageHeight":null,"imageWidth":null,"altText":"","videoUrl":null,"videoHeight":null,"videoWidth":null,"codeUrl":null,"prototypeUrl":null,"resourceName":null,"libraryModuleType":null,"moduleConfigurationOverrides":null,"contentChunkType":"TEXT","crbHeight":500,"linkUrl":null,"openLinkUrlInNewWindow":true,"showBorderAroundMedia":false,"useSolidBackgroundOnMedia":true,"isControl":false,"captionModifier":null,"captionModifierCustomName":null,"flex":1,"autoplayVideo":null,"snippetCode":null,"snippetLanguage":null,"snippetLineNumbers":true,"updatedTimestamp":"2026-07-07T06:03:46.849Z"}]},{"pageContentBlockId":"128d1906-fd4f-4e9e-ac42-210bed3587cb","pageContentBlockCanonId":"d5de5ee7-1fc5-4f05-907c-e3473bb89ad0","isHidden":false,"isSqueezed":false,"title":null,"pageSectionId":"b4b0e91d-2302-4f5e-b01b-1d22bb20b748","pageSectionCanonId":"a268eff